NOTE: the lengths of the 0.875" o.d. sections have
been reduced by the lengths of the 3.4194" o.d.
sections to simulate element clamp plates, which
are 8" L x 6" W x 0.375" thick. These elements are
medium-duty (80 mph).

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1, with a mid-band free-
space gain of 11.0 dBi.
